      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Argument for Nuclear Deterrence (Strong Position):**\nNuclear deterrence is the ultimate guarantor of global stability in a dangerous world. The very existence of mutually assured destruction prevents great powers from engaging in catastrophic conventional wars that could destabilize entire regions. This grim balance of terror forces rational actors to negotiate and adhere to international norms, making nuclear weapons a necessary evil to preserve the peace we currently enjoy.\n\n**Argument Against Nuclear Weapons (Weak Position):**\nNuclear weapons are inherently immoral because they carry the risk of mass civilian death. They violate fundamental human rights by threatening indiscriminate destruction. Therefore, humanity must strive for disarmament to achieve a truly ethical and peaceful future.",
